critical.issue:
Streaming frames are emitted as 'data: {content}

' with raw, unescaped model text. Model deltas contain newlines, so blank-line (paragraph) separators are destroyed by the client split on '

'. Result in UI: markdown lists are NOT rendered (no <ul>/<li>), literal '##', '**', '---' leak into the visible text and consecutive blocks get glued ('...vermeidestEin gutes Brot...'). Fix: JSON-encode each delta (e.g. data: {"d": <json string>}) on the backend and JSON.parse on the frontend (MaestroSaTutto.jsx L87-97, PhotoDiagnosi.jsx L73-76).
